      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……今天，\n走到哪里都能看到机伶金花的身影，\n真是奇妙的一天。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4f14cf2a5e5afb2ca5a3f4c8ca15a77da91355f9c7479238ba5a18e94be77157",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
