    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e7ac6cd93e89c26ef407c3da",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这些看似微不足道的小事，\n她却做得如此理所当然。\n在回避纷争的同时——",
      "source_fingerprint": "acf797f31d9918a6e23d57a0d4060f7da8a9333cc827de47fc62faf33983e153",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/80/1134/storytimeline_801134001.json",
