      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "就像许多花朵——\n汇聚成一束美丽的花束那样。\n宁静的时光与空间——我很、喜欢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "777593a5288bd9cb82d73cdae5d1cbcad50a25d08d0b8d4f6399f9b530809984",
