      "uid": "zhcn:179c3aa054afa7d8ac46cdf8",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "看着机伶金花那份温和恬静，\n仿佛她就是『调和』的化身。\n我把这份感受告诉了她——",
      "source_fingerprint": "0222db27ffe5657960034a10a7dd572898f7e9b3bcb2e6078c16f3cbfa417410",
