      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "——太、太夸张了。我并不是\n那么了不起的赛马娘。\n……不过——谢谢你。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ffef26726e05d3e6219efc28f49b3dc7349cf787c3cec814de913151539d9881",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
